          "The evidence standard for new-hire onboarding checklists is deliberately modest. Record the source with the date it was observed, and mark a missing value as missing. Do not fill a gap from memory because a later reviewer will treat the invented value as fact. HR Coordinators keeps the original source and the correction note side by side. At HR Coordinators, the new-hire onboarding checklists correction is dated and initialed."
