          "End the day by reconciling the new-hire onboarding checklists queue and explaining the carryover. The handoff should name what moved, what is waiting, who owns the next check, and which evidence is still missing. Keep the queue short enough to finish; a healthy average can hide one aged case. At HR Coordinators, the new-hire onboarding checklists handoff note is stored with the employee record."
