          "Record the exact source for new-hire onboarding checklists and the time it was observed. A later reviewer should be able to tell whether the value was current when the first action was taken. When the source is maintained by another team, name the contact and the expected response time. At HR Coordinators, the new-hire onboarding checklists escalation path is written next to the queue."
